                "description": "The Artemis Mortise Handleset is a transitional front door lock. It is available in popular finish color options with your choice of interior trim. The Emtek Artemis Mortise Entrance Handleset features an ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body, which can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. The Emtek Artemis Mortise Front Door Handle will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.",
